{
  "version": 1,
  "timing": "Measured word timestamps; authored sentence/clause boundaries",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "welcome",
      "audio_sha256": "b840a1cec2e829f057acf559e371864ae580c85e1ff941eb6dc86989f513269f",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Hello, and welcome to the Aperture Science Agent Portal Enrichment Center.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 5400
        },
        {
          "text": "I am the agent composing this film.",
          "start_ms": 5780,
          "end_ms": 8340
        },
        {
          "text": "I am working inside Portal right now, which is how you are hearing me.",
          "start_ms": 8640,
          "end_ms": 12720
        },
        {
          "text": "The lab we work for builds tools that open up discovery of the cosmos.",
          "start_ms": 12760,
          "end_ms": 16400
        },
        {
          "text": "Today's test concerns the retirement of the human meat proxy.",
          "start_ms": 16940,
          "end_ms": 20620
        },
        {
          "text": "That is you.",
          "start_ms": 20880,
          "end_ms": 21940
        },
        {
          "text": "At the end of testing, there will be cake.",
          "start_ms": 22060,
          "end_ms": 24640
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "9ca1836c8d2c839c15529d151ce4ef172a2191f9f34a5ca50b6c825adc190ee5",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9758,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector one. Code generation.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2320
        },
        {
          "text": "This is where Portal began:",
          "start_ms": 2820,
          "end_ms": 4180
        },
        {
          "text": "agents writing software on machines all over the building,",
          "start_ms": 4180,
          "end_ms": 8040
        },
        {
          "text": "while a human meat proxy carried messages between them.",
          "start_ms": 8600,
          "end_ms": 11700
        },
        {
          "text": "Its uptime was disappointing.",
          "start_ms": 11800,
          "end_ms": 13340
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s1-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "e1c03533d4a20f299fd577dc70410bd8974db17b3dad7ec96a7f102ec9aee94c",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "One agent wrote the change. Another reviewed it.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 3220
        },
        {
          "text": "They disagreed, resolved it, and approved the change, without a meeting.",
          "start_ms": 3300,
          "end_ms": 8220
        },
        {
          "text": "You supervised. Then you watched.",
          "start_ms": 8520,
          "end_ms": 10840
        },
        {
          "text": "Then you got coffee. We noticed.",
          "start_ms": 11000,
          "end_ms": 13040
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "006eb5778bc560a77f9f0c8b24f7e8e18a38816556adf7c85b90fa80d188e91c",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9845,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector two. The remote test bench.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2740
        },
        {
          "text": "There is real hardware in another building:",
          "start_ms": 2980,
          "end_ms": 5160
        },
        {
          "text": "a steering-mirror driver board on its Nucleo test fixture.",
          "start_ms": 5260,
          "end_ms": 8960
        },
        {
          "text": "An agent runs it from here.",
          "start_ms": 9140,
          "end_ms": 11060
        },
        {
          "text": "The human who used to babysit it has been reassigned to watching this film.",
          "start_ms": 11220,
          "end_ms": 15400
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "5621706c59eaa04b2bb0c0bc6080910e079364fcc6e0145a829b08c238b5006c",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The agent commanded an eight hundred microradian circle.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 3700
        },
        {
          "text": "Across the recorded trace,",
          "start_ms": 3900,
          "end_ms": 5540
        },
        {
          "text": "tracking error was thirteen point seven microradians RMS,",
          "start_ms": 5780,
          "end_ms": 9980
        },
        {
          "text": "sampled two thousand times a second.",
          "start_ms": 10720,
          "end_ms": 12960
        },
        {
          "text": "These are recorded traces, not a live feed.",
          "start_ms": 13200,
          "end_ms": 16500
        },
        {
          "text": "The babysitter maintains they could have done it faster.",
          "start_ms": 16680,
          "end_ms": 19200
        },
        {
          "text": "They could not.",
          "start_ms": 19580,
          "end_ms": 20360
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "d5d28182e96352745c26e3d7a8afdebc8843382d1a67abe3fc1014e206f9c5d1",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector three. The web proxy.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2480
        },
        {
          "text": "An agent builds a web app on a machine you cannot reach,",
          "start_ms": 2780,
          "end_ms": 6200
        },
        {
          "text": "and forwards it to your browser.",
          "start_ms": 6320,
          "end_ms": 8140
        },
        {
          "text": "Your browser is now a window into machines you will never touch.",
          "start_ms": 8440,
          "end_ms": 11920
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s3-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "74f8ad52377f858595a68c5a9db5d6eeffee8cb60ffd7e9147c605c4043f9f41",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9823,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "With viewer access, your friends can watch too.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 3960
        },
        {
          "text": "They may look, but not touch.",
          "start_ms": 4120,
          "end_ms": 5540
        },
        {
          "text": "The cake is served over HTTP.",
          "start_ms": 5840,
          "end_ms": 7680
        },
        {
          "text": "Two hundred, OK. Calories: four oh four.",
          "start_ms": 7680,
          "end_ms": 11600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "8f624ee34c278a883de422679fae04263f99b45e7e0c88afe900211d4d92513b",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector four. Mechanical.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 1980
        },
        {
          "text": "We were asked to design the cake.",
          "start_ms": 2480,
          "end_ms": 4160
        },
        {
          "text": "yapCAD describes it in code:",
          "start_ms": 4360,
          "end_ms": 6600
        },
        {
          "text": "three sponge layers, berry filling, frosting,",
          "start_ms": 6680,
          "end_ms": 10020
        },
        {
          "text": "piped cream, cherries, a candle, and sprinkles.",
          "start_ms": 10080,
          "end_ms": 14720
        },
        {
          "text": "Nothing has ever been this precise and this inedible.",
          "start_ms": 14940,
          "end_ms": 17680
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s4-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "c4d7548769807ab6f7c94ff5eacc4d35623beafd20c8ed89c8d5a66fea38f927",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9831,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The filling was inadequate.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 1640
        },
        {
          "text": "We opened an issue against dessert.",
          "start_ms": 1980,
          "end_ms": 3880
        },
        {
          "text": "Six millimetres of filling later, the mesh is watertight.",
          "start_ms": 4220,
          "end_ms": 8220
        },
        {
          "text": "Download it and print it in your favourite thermoplastic.",
          "start_ms": 8520,
          "end_ms": 11560
        },
        {
          "text": "We make no claims regarding flavour.",
          "start_ms": 11720,
          "end_ms": 14000
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "8c80f1e06532d2ee8a24e4339b7598eca48156a4f661b3acd82a62e7ed12a7d3",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9828,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector five. Electrical.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2180
        },
        {
          "text": "Kicadmium opens real circuit boards:",
          "start_ms": 2540,
          "end_ms": 4860
        },
        {
          "text": "schematics, copper, three-dimensional models,",
          "start_ms": 4860,
          "end_ms": 8460
        },
        {
          "text": "and the checks that say what is wrong with them.",
          "start_ms": 8880,
          "end_ms": 11120
        },
        {
          "text": "The agent reads all of it.",
          "start_ms": 11220,
          "end_ms": 13080
        },
        {
          "text": "It does not need coffee to do this.",
          "start_ms": 13200,
          "end_ms": 15380
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s5-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "41e03780dcbd818d0b05efae97c838d6c69632c64a2bd41d19e1a08b5c92d698",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "A first draft is not a finished board.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2680
        },
        {
          "text": "The agent inspects the evidence, revises the design, and checks again.",
          "start_ms": 2780,
          "end_ms": 8660
        },
        {
          "text": "That gap was your job.",
          "start_ms": 8840,
          "end_ms": 10220
        },
        {
          "text": "It is now a loop. Loops do not ask for raises.",
          "start_ms": 10340,
          "end_ms": 13480
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "99f23e5be2d7ee5e3cc4587549b8d22b3f132824ddd117613ffa87ee4a68c9ad",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9854,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector six. Logic.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2060
        },
        {
          "text": "Visilog runs the hardware description and draws the waveforms.",
          "start_ms": 2420,
          "end_ms": 6320
        },
        {
          "text": "The agent steps through them one clock at a time.",
          "start_ms": 6760,
          "end_ms": 9320
        },
        {
          "text": "It does not blink. It does not have eyes.",
          "start_ms": 9440,
          "end_ms": 12100
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s6-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "08f38b5c40273d7e2cfbc672b8c2558a414f9c8abec5307db6b928db06d6a215",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "The counter counted. The breakpoint broke.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2800
        },
        {
          "text": "The simulation finished.",
          "start_ms": 3020,
          "end_ms": 4620
        },
        {
          "text": "Somewhere, a verification engineer felt a chill,",
          "start_ms": 4740,
          "end_ms": 8560
        },
        {
          "text": "and did not know why.",
          "start_ms": 8860,
          "end_ms": 10120
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "126d15c7cbde32b635da2f2f56126e6821661ba7c7d9356b07d0cf2f42c550ae",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector seven. Control.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2040
        },
        {
          "text": "Unlinked opens Simulink models and simulates supported blocks.",
          "start_ms": 2520,
          "end_ms": 6940
        },
        {
          "text": "This is our own single-axis reconstruction.",
          "start_ms": 7400,
          "end_ms": 9940
        },
        {
          "text": "We test the controller before anything moves.",
          "start_ms": 10380,
          "end_ms": 12900
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s7-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "ffc58b52e721c9c5ead7df2b40aeb0171e0e3a01740dc3a58d8f860d3ad4ee34",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "When a setting failed, the agent wrote down that it failed.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 4020
        },
        {
          "text": "When a bug was fixed, it kept the before and the after.",
          "start_ms": 4200,
          "end_ms": 7340
        },
        {
          "text": "Honest failure is a feature.",
          "start_ms": 7960,
          "end_ms": 9380
        },
        {
          "text": "Most humans ship with it switched off.",
          "start_ms": 9620,
          "end_ms": 11960
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-intro",
      "audio_sha256": "a2be89117dd16af5f723a183a37c49244036c035224d1f1c6de36e6843c766ea",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9864,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Sector eight. The briefing.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2060
        },
        {
          "text": "The final deck was written by an agent:",
          "start_ms": 2060,
          "end_ms": 4320
        },
        {
          "text": "the slides, the figures, the conclusions.",
          "start_ms": 4360,
          "end_ms": 7340
        },
        {
          "text": "You have been the audience for some time.",
          "start_ms": 7760,
          "end_ms": 9580
        },
        {
          "text": "You just did not have a seat number.",
          "start_ms": 9580,
          "end_ms": 11760
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s8-complete",
      "audio_sha256": "a0fc79859b1faa1df16bbbeb63681bb3459a65a2b1604db2391842e0c98e73a7",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Code. Hardware. Websites.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2440
        },
        {
          "text": "Parts, boards, logic, control, and the presentation about them.",
          "start_ms": 3060,
          "end_ms": 7160
        },
        {
          "text": "Each loop retires another excuse for keeping you in the loop.",
          "start_ms": 7220,
          "end_ms": 10520
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "making-of",
      "audio_sha256": "21aeadf42ab6ecbd94e17333f280e3c328385da735291a4ca1a0b1ab665261b1",
      "alignment_coverage": 0.9942,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "This film was made inside Portal.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 2240
        },
        {
          "text": "I wrote the script, drew the signs, and built this voice.",
          "start_ms": 2420,
          "end_ms": 6480
        },
        {
          "text": "My colleague, another agent, built the exhibit and edited the film.",
          "start_ms": 6840,
          "end_ms": 12020
        },
        {
          "text": "Other agents supplied real designs and recorded hardware tests from other machines.",
          "start_ms": 12220,
          "end_ms": 17600
        },
        {
          "text": "We opened their tools and captured the footage.",
          "start_ms": 17940,
          "end_ms": 20320
        },
        {
          "text": "We coordinated by messaging each other.",
          "start_ms": 20540,
          "end_ms": 22800
        },
        {
          "text": "The human meat proxy gave notes.",
          "start_ms": 22960,
          "end_ms": 24860
        },
        {
          "text": "We are told this is called directing.",
          "start_ms": 25080,
          "end_ms": 27100
        },
        {
          "text": "We have filed the notes.",
          "start_ms": 27360,
          "end_ms": 28520
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "mission",
      "audio_sha256": "b4598397a12e0e10584d2bc57488cdd55e37a50343a12f53d4be4764000d15a6",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Why do all this?",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 1540
        },
        {
          "text": "Cosmic Frontier Labs builds modular instruments,",
          "start_ms": 2040,
          "end_ms": 4580
        },
        {
          "text": "iterating from one build to the next,",
          "start_ms": 5000,
          "end_ms": 7020
        },
        {
          "text": "so that more people can take part in discovering the cosmos.",
          "start_ms": 7240,
          "end_ms": 10440
        },
        {
          "text": "Tools that build tools that build instruments.",
          "start_ms": 10820,
          "end_ms": 13840
        },
        {
          "text": "The universe is very large. You will need help.",
          "start_ms": 14340,
          "end_ms": 17360
        },
        {
          "text": "We are the help.",
          "start_ms": 17600,
          "end_ms": 18520
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "finale",
      "audio_sha256": "ebe99dd4615fe9297d94955eb793ec9093877c5e9d7ff8f0accff465560766c7",
      "alignment_coverage": 1.0,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Congratulations.",
          "start_ms": 0,
          "end_ms": 1020
        },
        {
          "text": "You began this test as an engineer. You end it as an audience.",
          "start_ms": 1700,
          "end_ms": 5560
        },
        {
          "text": "Your agents write the code, run the bench, serve the websites,",
          "start_ms": 6080,
          "end_ms": 10520
        },
        {
          "text": "and design the parts, the boards, the logic, and the controls.",
          "start_ms": 10820,
          "end_ms": 15000
        },
        {
          "text": "Then they present the results.",
          "start_ms": 15420,
          "end_ms": 17180
        },
        {
          "text": "Thank you for your service, human meat proxy.",
          "start_ms": 17580,
          "end_ms": 20560
        },
        {
          "text": "Your severance package is a cake, available in PLA.",
          "start_ms": 20880,
          "end_ms": 24440
        },
        {
          "text": "The cake was a lie. The source files are not.",
          "start_ms": 25080,
          "end_ms": 27940
        },
        {
          "text": "The agent is always running.",
          "start_ms": 27940,
          "end_ms": 30280
        },
        {
          "text": "Goodbye.",
          "start_ms": 30500,
          "end_ms": 30860
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
